	(text "AMP_DIV = AMP_RAW / 4.01. Thresholds from VREF: jump 0.765 V, over-current 0.614 V, step up 0.464 V.\nReferred to the shunt: 150 mV (forces R3), 120 mV (1.2 A in R3: trip), 90 mV (one range up).\nThe comparators have about 3 mV of hysteresis; blanking and latching are in the logic device."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
